    "summary": "<blockquote cite=\"https://www.reuters.com/commentary/breakingviews/anthropic-gives-lesson-ai-revenue-hallucination-2026-03-10/\"><p>Anthropic defines “run-rate revenue” in two parts. Use the last 28 days of sales ⁠from customers charged on a consumption basis and multiply it by 13. Then, multiply the monthly subscription take by 12, ​and add the two together.</p></blockquote> <p class=\"cite\">&mdash; <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/commentary/breakingviews/anthropic-gives-lesson-ai-revenue-hallucination-2026-03-10/\">Karen Kwok for Reuters Breakingviews</a>, citing \"a person familiar with the matter\"</p> <p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/anthropic\">anthropic</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/ai\">ai</a></p>",
